[32m+[m[32m4. Prioritization outcome[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe chosen minimum viable scope is a local web application that accepts supported evidence, runs modality-specific analysis,[m
[32m+[m[32mstores case/evidence records, exposes analysis through APIs, and supports timeline-oriented review and case Q&A.;[m
[32m+[m[32mHighest-risk follow-up work is grounding/consistency validation, followed by repeatable testing and report generation.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m5. Ethical and operational guardrails[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mUse synthetic or lawfully authorized test evidence. Keep evidence access restricted. Treat object detections, captions,[m
[32m+[m[32mtranscriptions and LLM-generated event descriptions as fallible leads. Preserve the original uploaded file, distinguish observation[m
[32m+[m[32mfrom inference, and require human review before any investigative decision.[m
